,"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510","source_question_id":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6f951d43b9d74962ddc44790d7584d6979701eb2826226bd90ae51c3759228a1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. I.（7分）（1）图甲为某学习小组做“探究求合力的方法”实验，图乙是其在白纸上根据实验结果画出的图。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/62d9e495c9de49bf0135aa45dab998cd2f126f53d0e6555b44de3d484a70ca0c.png","width":274,"height":218,"width_mm":32.131,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1a5f60640c3653c48ff05965617b07d466cd3c0bde218c6d6493879b84d7205f.png","width":248,"height":301,"width_mm":28.981,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/62dad30b0a35faae2640aebccc74f5248d0a086205b697b638128d431dce3227.png","width":288,"height":254,"width_mm":33.811,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n第14-I题图1\n①为了准确得到合力与分力的关系，要采用作力的 （填空） （填 “图示” 或 “示意图”）来表示分力与合力；\n②某次实验中弹簧测力计的示数如图丙所示，则拉力的大小为 （填空） N;\n③下列有关该实验的说法中，正确的是（填空）；\nA. 该实验弹簧测力计使用前要竖直悬挂调零\nB. 弹簧测力计的外壳与白纸之间有摩擦，对实验误差没有影响\nC. 图乙中力 F 沿图甲中 AO 延长线方向\nD. 只有一个弹簧测力计无法完成该实验\n（2）该学习小组继续用如图丁所示的实验装置来做“探究小车加速度与力、质量的关系”的实验。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/de3629df73c2581e59a1703c3d344c749d3de10f4a2ca3870667e1a2908d1a40.png","width":1424,"height":431,"width_mm":167.322,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n①为消除阻力对实验的影响，某同学操作如下：将小车静止放在水平长木板上，把长木板不带滑轮的一端慢慢垫高，如图戊所示，直到小车带着纸带由静止开始沿长木板向下滑动，即认为刚好补偿阻力完毕。该同学补偿阻力的操作（填空）（选填“正确”或“不正确”）；\n②实验中 （填空） （选填“需要”或“不需要”）满足所挂钩码的质量远小于小车的质量；\n③如果该同学已经按照①中的操作补偿阻力，在小车质量 M 不变时，通过改变钩码的质量，得到 a-F 的图像是 （填空）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2b185fc51ec3c3c529c42436bbd56df9c5650b33f3f886bcd17ca3946f4ec60d.png","width":221,"height":209,"width_mm":25.831,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a485c81a1d120523ea9fc5c017bba8d3921ec53446dd05324508e753769d8235.png","width":227,"height":219,"width_mm":26.671,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4d811ba83d0de4a9bc5f30e0cc59f02787e7eeaea50de0c32e5beca0a16c7d8d.png","width":231,"height":213,"width_mm":27.091,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2358b40e627bc7b2988f618654f8c5b45d5198aaed5a4c878fec19100f5947dd.png","width":213,"height":226,"width_mm":24.991,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\nD\n④每得到一条纸带，分析其数据，可在 a-F 图像上做出 （填空） 个点（选填 “1” 或 “多”）。\nII.（7分）（1）某小组同学先用半偏法通过如图甲所示的电路来测量灵敏电流计G的内阻，滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 应（填空） （填“远大于”或“远小于”） "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{g}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；实验步骤如下：\n①实验时，先断开开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，闭合开关 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，调节滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，使得 G 的示数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{g}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n②保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值不变，再闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，调节电阻箱 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，使得 G 的示数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}I_{g}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，此时电阻箱 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的示数如图乙所示，则 G 的内阻为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n根据实验方案可知：该实验中 G 的内阻测量值 （填空） (选填 “大于” 或 “小于”) 真实值。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0cab277a536aace56f26d45ac547e72284ffae91df7f1c8f483b854aa8ec59a3.png","width":403,"height":263,"width_mm":47.252,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","valu