 不需要； ③ C； ④ 1\n14.II.（7分）\n(1) 远大于；48.0；小于\n(2) 仍使灵敏电流计的示数为零；1.44；1.33；没有"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510","source_question_id":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8662486727eded54e05d7f48823000955b37496f927679b1593d1dfb3442cc86","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）如图所示，导热性良好的圆柱形气缸竖直悬挂于天花板，用横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=0.01m^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{0}=1kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光滑活塞封闭一定质量的理想气体，活塞下悬挂质量为m=80kg的重物，此时活塞处在距气缸上底面0.3m的A处（图中未标注），环境温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}=300K"},{"type":"text","value":" 。随着环境温度升高，活塞缓慢移动到距离气缸上底面0.36m的B处（图中未标注）。已知大气压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{0}=1.01\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" ，忽略大气压的变化，则：\n（1）求活塞在 B 处时环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2) 活塞从 A 处到 B 处的过程中气体分子平均动能 （填空） (选填 “变大”, “变小”, 或 “不变”), 气体分子对容器壁单位时间单位面积的撞击次数 （填空） (选填 “变大”, “变小”, 或 “不变”)。\n（3）活塞从A处到B处的过程中气体内能增加了 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 132\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求此过程中气体从外界吸收的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9f4513a4340e005397d20a8eed13a65f73124d604c9f5247c4573ea2e7aa3ba1.png","width":235,"height":418,"width_mm":27.511,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8分)\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"A \\rightarrow B"},{"type":"text","value":"等压变化："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}} = \\frac{V_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2} = 360K"},{"type":"text","value":"2分\n(2) 变大 变小 2 分\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}S + (m_{0} + m)g = P_{0}S"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1} = 2\\times 10^{4}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -P_{1}S\\Delta h = -P_{2}S\\Delta h = -2\\times 10^{4}\\times 0.01\\times 0.06 = -12\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = Q + W"},{"type":"text","value":"有"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = \\Delta U - W = 132 - (-12) = 144\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"……2分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510","source_question_id":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5857186d836262a1921effe7a5957fe5de905be04e5b31b97f408b41b0b627c1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）如图所示，固定在竖直面上的两个光滑半圆形轨道I、II和长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}=\\frac{5}{16}m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平粗糙地面EF相连，F点正上方存在一个固定的挡板，小球碰到挡板后以原速率的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 反弹。两个半圆形轨道的半径分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=0.25m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=0.5m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，轨道最高点P的切线恰好水平。轨道I左侧有一个弹性水平发射装置，质量为m=0.1kg的小球被弹出后恰好过P点（即不发生脱轨）。F点右侧紧挨着两辆相互紧靠（但不粘连）、质量均为M=0.2kg的摆渡车A、B，摆渡车长均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}=4m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与物块之间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}=0.15"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与地面的摩擦可忽略，小球可视为质点，g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求：\n（1）小球刚到达轨道I的顶端，即将进入轨道II时，轨道I对小球的压力大小；\n（2）弹射过程中发射装置对小球做的功；\n（3）小球最终停在 EF 上的位置；\n（4）若没有弹性挡板，求摆渡车 A 的最终速度大小及小球在摆渡车 A、B 上滑行时产生的总热量 Q。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b233f179123799bc5f9c1074a5b2fce1974ffbc569cbfbb3a51a32fccc60702b.png","width":613,"height":329,"width_mm":72.033,"row_group":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11 分)\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=m\\frac{v_{P}^{2}}{R_{2}}, v_{P}=\\sqrt{gR_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"; 1分"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}+mg=m\\frac{v_{P}^{2}}{R_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=(\\frac{R_{2}}{R_{1}}-1)mg"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=mg=1N"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（2）根据能量守恒定律，从小球被弹射到达轨道顶端的过程中有："},{"type":"math","value":"W=mg\\cdot2R_{1}+\\frac{1}{2}mv_{P}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"W=3mgR_{1}=0.75J"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{P} = \\sqrt{5} \\, \\text{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，从"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"点第一次到"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"点：由动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"mg \\cdot 2R_{2} - \\mu_{1} mg L_{1} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{F}^{2} - \\frac{1}{2} mv_{P}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F} = 2\\sqrt{5} \\, \\text{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分\n碰后速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F1} = \\sqrt{15} \\, \\text{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"第二次碰后速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{2} \\, \\text{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"…… 1 分\n经分析，最终停在距"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"点"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{15}{64} \\, \\text{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"。…… 1 分（4）由动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\cdot 2R_{2}-\\mu_{1}mgL_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{P}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=2\\sqrt{5}\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"小球在A上滑行时，推动A、B一起运动，设物块到达A末端时A、B的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由动量守恒和能量守恒得"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{F}=mv_{1}+2Mv_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}mgL_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2Mv_{A}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{6\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分此后物块在B上滑行时，推动B继续加速，设物块与B共速时的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"，物块与B的相对位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta L"},{"type":"text","value":"，由动量守恒和能量守恒得"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1}+Mv_{A}=(m+M)v_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}mg\\Delta L=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}Mv_{A}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}(m+M)v_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta L=\\frac{10}{9}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分物块在摆渡车上滑行时产生的热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\mu_{2}mg(L_{2}+\\Delta L)=\\frac{23}{30}\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510","source_question_id":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8629499e73e826189688415ccd7923e4f76ae4b0be326114cd55c134932ff7f1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）如图所示，两个金属轮 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，可绕各自中心固定的光滑金属细轴 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 转动。 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 金属轮由3根金属辐条和金属环组成，每根辐条长均为4L、电阻均为2R。 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 金属轮由1根金属辐条和金属环组成，辐条长为2L、电阻为R。半径为L的绝缘圆盘 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 同轴且固定在一起。用轻绳一端固定在 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 边缘上，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 上绕足够匝数后（忽略 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的半径变化），悬挂一质量为m的重物P。当P下落时，通过细绳带动 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value"