}=\\frac{9BL^{2}}{2R}"},{"type":"text","value":"2分\n（4）充电稳定：重力的功率与产生的热功率相等，设重物的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"mgv=\\frac{(12BLv)^{2}}{\\frac{8R}{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{mgR}{54B^{2}L^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分导线切割磁感线产生的电动势为"},{"type":"math","value":"E'=12BLv"},{"type":"text","value":"稳定时电容器两端的电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}=\\frac{3}{8}E'=\\frac{9}{2}BLv=\\frac{mgR}{12BL}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分打向"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"，待金属棒"},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":"运动稳定时，金属棒"},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":"的电动势与电容器电压相等，金属棒"},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":"的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"稳定，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"CBLv_{1}=Q-Q', Q=CU_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"BLQ'=Mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{CmgR}{12(M+CB^{2}L^{2})}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510","source_question_id":"jiangzhewan-gongtongti-2510-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"543d7a157cdc55468d16e721f601580ab7f23629e1eb1cf853ef0b9ae1317db8","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）托卡马克装置是一种利用磁约束来实现受控核聚变的环形容器，将容器简化为如图甲所示的足够长的空心圆柱，其半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 3R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"PQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 为空心圆柱的中心轴。圆柱内部以半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆为边界分成两部分磁场，正视图如图乙所示，外环分布有垂直纸面向外磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac{1}{2} B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场；内环分布有逆时针的环形磁场，磁感应强度大小处处相等且大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。在 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点设置一原子核发射装置